{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55777","headline":"示学偈 · 道溥","name":"示学偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瞎眼善解通，聋耳却获功。\n一体归无性，六处本来同。\n我今齐举唱。\n方便示汝浓（疑应作「侬」）。\n相传佛祖印，继续老胡宗。\n（均见《祖堂集》卷十一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道溥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}